  <p id="c-nanqishu-053-shenxun-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-053-shenxun-family:p001:m0000" ref="8c4_l2o_krm_AA">沈憲</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-053-shenxun-family:p001:m0003" ref="8c4_l2o_krm_AA">彥璋</persName>，吳興武康人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-053-shenxun-family:p001:m0014" ref="8c4_l2o_krm">說道</persName>，巴西梓潼二郡太守，父<persName id="c-nanqishu-053-shenxun-family:p001:m0027" ref="8c4_l2o_krm_A">璞之</persName>，北中郎行參軍。</p>
